WEBVTT

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.750
<i>The culture festival 
will finally begin tomorrow.</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:32.010
<i>I once had someone precious 
that I wished to protect.</i>

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>Maids, Ghosts, 
and the Stage of Dreams</b>

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:06.980
The culture festival starts 
for real tomorrow.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.810
<b>Fujimiya</b>

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.810
Everyone's in a mad rush.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:13.690
Some students are prioritizing their 
club projects for the festival, like us,

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.070
and others are focusing mainly 
on their class projects.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.340
Huh?

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:22.400
Come to think of it, 
what was our class going to do?

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.440
We decided that in homeroom.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:25.580
Don't you remember?

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:30.830
<b>Acting</b>

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:30.830
Uh... I haven't had room in my head 
for anything but acting...

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:35.340
Yeah, lately you've been working
day and night, as if your life depended on it.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.220
If nothing else, I must admit I'm 
impressed by how focused you are.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.930
To the point you haven't noticed <i>that</i>.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.470
<b>Acting</b>

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:41.470
Huh?

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.230
Yikes...

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.100
<b>Haunted House</b>

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.780
Oh, a haunted house?

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:53.610
Isn't this something you 
wanted to try, Hina-chan?

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:56.150
Huh? No, I didn't really...

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.690
If you're aiming to be a stage actress,

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.780
you need to be able to play any role.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.740
But I can't do this!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.470
I'd freeze in front of everyone

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.870
and turn into a scarecrow!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.100
That could work, actually.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.500
Yes, it could.

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:18.000
Huh?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.130
Oh, so your class is doing a haunted house?

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.140
What's your class doing, Mayu-chan?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.190
Can't you tell?

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:30.560
A maid outfit...

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.870
So it is.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.650
Which means...

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.880
Which means?

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.900
Mayu-chan's dressed like usual...

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.680
Does that mean you're 
in the going home club?

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.660
Will you be working at Hitotose's 
coffee shop during the festival, too?

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.160
No!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.220
I'm wearing a maid outfit,

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.660
so I'm obviously a maid!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.260
We're doing a maid café!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.260
She's so cute.

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:56.040
Mayu-chan's doing what 
she always does, I see.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:59.300
Jeez! Why don't you guys get it?!

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.790
Looks like the maid café 
part is true, though.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.090
<b>Maid Café</b>

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.050
Welcome!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.880
It looks like there are 
lots more Mayu-chans.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.430
All of their costumes 
were made based on mine.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.440
Oh! We have to hurry, too!

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.440
Can't breathe...

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.540
Almost got it...

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.200
Aki-chan, help me!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.950
Okay.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.450
There! All done!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.750
You look beautiful, Hina-chan!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.440
Yeah.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.120
It looks great!

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.300
Not bad, I guess.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.020
Sorry you had to help me 
get dressed, Mayu-chan.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.870
I know you're busy with 
your class's café, too.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.590
It was nothing.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:52.850
Besides, I helped with the other 
theater club members' outfits.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:56.230
I wanted to at least help you put yours on.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.730
Thanks!

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:01.790
I truly thank you.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.610
You've done wonderfully with 
the heroine's wardrobe.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:08.120
Now, the rest of you 
should get changed, as well.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.370
Okay!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:17.250
I-I'm Sakuragi Hinako, and I'll be 
playing the h-heroine.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:22.380
I'm Nakajima Yua, and I'm playing the 
wealthy young detective who solves the case.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.010
I'm Natsukawa Kuina, and I'm playing 
the caretaker of the mansion.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.300
And this is...

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:32.660
Hiiragi Mayuki-san, 
who's playing the mansion's maid.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.890
Pleased to meet you.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.270
Huh? Wait! I'm not in the play!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:44.150
You didn't look out of place 
among the cast at all.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.520
Yeah! You should be in it, Mayu-chan!

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.880
L-Like I told you, I work behind the scenes!

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:51.720
Darn it...

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.790
I hope you'll join us next time, though.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.790
<i>She's so cute.</i>

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.490
<i>With the costumes on,</i>

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:59.290
<i>everyone's starting to look 
just like their characters.</i>

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:03.300
<i>Yua-chan really looks like a 
wealthy young detective, too.</i>

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.800
<i>And I'd almost think Kuu-chan 
really is a caretaker at a mansion.</i>

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.180
<i>And the landlady's in her tracksuit...</i>

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.370
Huh? Tracksuit?!

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.770
Is something wrong?

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.180
U-Um, the landlady is...

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:19.290
Landlady?

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.020
Uh, I mean... um...

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:25.420
Chiaki-senpai is still in her tracksuit,

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.990
so I was a bit surprised...

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.020
What?

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.370
I'm working behind the scenes this time.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.840
I won't be in the play.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.890
Y-You won't?

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.700
Hina-chan, you didn't know?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.660
N-No...

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:44.000
I mean, you've remained active 
in the theater club all this time, right?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:44.710
Yeah.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:50.210
But I talked to Sensei 
and decided that we should

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.970
keep the focus on 
the new members this time.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.540
That's right.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.580
The script I wrote for this production

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.350
is better suited to fresh, new performers.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.810
Oh...

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.340
You've been working on 
memorizing the script, haven't you?

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:06.160
How could you not notice 
who the other actors were?

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:11.990
J-Just memorizing my own lines 
and cues took all of my brain power...

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:16.120
I only just finished memorizing 
all my lines last night.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.370
You do have a lot of lines, 
being the heroine and all.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:22.750
W-Well, I get that, but...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.880
Still, it's unbelievable that she didn't 
even read the other actors' parts.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.560
It is indeed an unusual approach,

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:32.630
but it's okay for acting styles 
to differ from person to person.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:38.400
Some read the whole script and 
calculate how they should act within it,

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.640
while others focus on mastering 
only their own part.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.150
Hinako-san.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.400
The culprit can be none other than you!

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:58.090
No, I'm not the culprit!

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:02.790
I wasn't here in the 
great hall at that hour!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:06.290
<i>Huh? I just reacted naturally...</i>

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.760
Please continue.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.160
<i>Hinako-san is truly special.</i>

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.350
Okay.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.800
<i>The fact that her line came to her instantly</i>

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:13.700
I only just arrived here yesterday.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.040
<i>proves that she is one with her role.</i>

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:18.820
To be stuck in the middle of this incident 
all of a sudden is truly a shock.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:19.500
<i>My choice to cast her as the heroine 
was clearly not a mistake.</i>

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:23.350
I never thought this vacation that I was 
supposed to enjoy would end like this.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:25.480
Sh-She's not bad...

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:31.490
This morning, I seriously considered 
leaving this mansion.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.900
Aki-chan, don't tell her.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.660
I once had someone precious 
that I wished to protect.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.960
<i>Is she going to do that 
during the play, too?</i>

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.840
I never thought an incident 
like this would happen...

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.840
Someone here is the culprit!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:56.590
And this handkerchief is 
the greatest evidence of that.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.850
It can't be... It can't be!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.230
I can't believe it! It was you?!

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.100
Yes.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:12.190
I had someone precious 
that I wished to protect.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.120
Well done.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:22.690
That's the first time I've made it to the end 
without messing up any of my lines!

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.940
Yeah, though you came 
dangerously close at one point.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.710
You were great, Hina-chan!

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:30.340
Yeah! I can't wait until tomorrow!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.400
Yeah.

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:34.340
Thank you! Thank you, everyone!

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:37.590
I couldn't have done it without all of you!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.200
I made it this far because of you all...

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.620
Your hard work paid off, Hina-chan!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.350
Kuu-chan...

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.090
You know...

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:49.310
Ah, Yua-chan, great job—

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.960
The show isn't over yet!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.730
Oh, yeah.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:54.990
Look, you two...

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.110
Now, we'll rehearse it one more time.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.740
The show is tomorrow.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:02.740
We have no time for playing around, everyone.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:03.840
Right!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.840
<b>Fujimiya Festival</b>

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.510
<b>Tea Club 
Tea Room</b>

